From c855f0ce35e10b9522d7e3bc083ead47d2405b49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Setup wizard of LECH OS: name, logo and Slovak texts

LECH OS is built on GrapheneOS (ADR-0012) and must not carry its name:
the setup wizard welcomed with "Welcome to GrapheneOS" and its icon, in
English only (Pixel 9, 14. 11. 2026). The welcome screen now names LECH OS
and the wizard shows the LECH OS logo: the vector icon of the base is removed
and tools/etapa2/12-zostav-pixel.sh copies res/drawable-nodpi/grapheneos_icon.png
from vendor/lech (welcome and final screen). All texts have a
Slovak translation. The descriptions of the network location and the
geocoder still name GrapheneOS: its servers provide these services.
The link for locking the bootloader (grapheneos.org/UBL) stays for now;
it is shown only with an unlocked bootloader.
---
